Payments Integration
Explain how Payment Gateways work, describe the payments flow, discuss the security and standards followed ( PCI DSS ) 

Begin by selecting a suitable payment gateway like Razorpay, Stripe
Lookout for integration related code in the docs like for Razorpay - https://razorpay.com/docs/payments/server-integration/nodejs/payment-gateway/build-integration/

React specific integration -
https://razorpay.com/docs/payments/server-integration/nodejs/faqs/#3-can-i-integrate-razorpay-checkout-with-reactjs

 - Role of webhooks, HTTP Tunneling ( used for webhook when backend running locally )
Security
a.	Discuss bcrypt.  discuss salt and encryption .  using bcrypt for password hashing
b.	Different node packages for added security measures like express-rate-limiter ( api rate limiting ), express-mongo-sanitize ( for no-sql injection ) , helmet ( hiding server details in response), etc

Deployment Flow

a.	Maintain code in github 
b.	Can use aws or for simple deployment process, can use Render
c.	For frontend deployment many use Netlify. If you do so, then can use Render for backend apis and then connect to it through URL in Netlify
d.	Remember to handle CORS issue 

